    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odd Town</strong> is an immersive, retro-styled, first-person adventure game where dark humor, open-ended exploration, and chaotic storytelling collide. It\u2019s a bite-sized open-world mystery that blends <strong>retro visuals</strong>, <strong>dark humor</strong>, and <strong>Twin Peaks-style surrealism</strong>...\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>When your car breaks down in the secluded town of <strong>Saint Sectaire</strong>, you think it's just bad luck. But as you explore its cobbled streets, odd jobs, and even odder locals, you begin to uncover something far darker beneath the surface\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes you on a journey through a mysterious small town inhabited by a diverse and eccentric ensemble of unique characters. \u00a0What starts as a series of simple odd-jobs to settle a debt quickly escalates into an investigation involving kidnapping, corruption and murder, with a tint of seemingly supernatural occurrences. The story is told through a series of short missions, each one driving the plot forward in a focused manner.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Handcrafted, Living, Breathing Town</strong><br>Meet strange locals, take on quirky jobs, uncover hidden locations, and poke around where you\u2019re not supposed to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Story Missions + Side Content</strong><br>Unravel a creepy, slow-burn story by completing handcrafted missions spread across the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for Cash</strong><br>Earn cash by working as a baker, janitor \u2014 or even something less legal. Use your money wisely: buy tools, food, clothes, or bribe your way out of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World, Reactive NPCs</strong><br>Locals will remember you. Make enemies, trigger fights, or get banned from shops based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Caught, Face Consequences</strong><br>Break the law and risk jail. But don\u2019t worry \u2014 there are multiple ways to escape... once. Use them all, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wanted System</strong><br>Escape jail or get reported, and you\u2019ll become a <strong>wanted man</strong>. While flagged, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lay low</strong>, avoid police patrols, and be careful who sees you. You will have to buy new clothes to become anonymous again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Right Tool for the Job</strong><br>Unlock shortcuts, burglarize stores, access secret areas and more! \u2014 if you have the right equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odd Town</strong> is an immersive, retro-styled, first-person adventure game where dark humor, open-ended exploration, and chaotic storytelling collide. It\u2019s a bite-sized open-world mystery that blends <strong>retro visuals</strong>, <strong>dark humor</strong>, and <strong>Twin Peaks-style surrealism</strong>...\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/9f20db3bbe0d984c7bf1a361b283fa1d.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>When your car breaks down in the secluded town of <strong>Saint Sectaire</strong>, you think it's just bad luck. But as you explore its cobbled streets, odd jobs, and even odder locals, you begin to uncover something far darker beneath the surface\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes you on a journey through a mysterious small town inhabited by a diverse and eccentric ensemble of unique characters. \u00a0What starts as a series of simple odd-jobs to settle a debt quickly escalates into an investigation involving kidnapping, corruption and murder, with a tint of seemingly supernatural occurrences. The story is told through a series of short missions, each one driving the plot forward in a focused manner.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/76e6c0d65fc234f40059718b29f568fa.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Handcrafted, Living, Breathing Town</strong><br>Meet strange locals, take on quirky jobs, uncover hidden locations, and poke around where you\u2019re not supposed to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Story Missions + Side Content</strong><br>Unravel a creepy, slow-burn story by completing handcrafted missions spread across the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for Cash</strong><br>Earn cash by working as a baker, janitor \u2014 or even something less legal. Use your money wisely: buy tools, food, clothes, or bribe your way out of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World, Reactive NPCs</strong><br>Locals will remember you. Make enemies, trigger fights, or get banned from shops based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Caught, Face Consequences</strong><br>Break the law and risk jail. But don\u2019t worry \u2014 there are multiple ways to escape... once. Use them all, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wanted System</strong><br>Escape jail or get reported, and you\u2019ll become a <strong>wanted man</strong>. While flagged, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lay low</strong>, avoid police patrols, and be careful who sees you. You will have to buy new clothes to become anonymous again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Right Tool for the Job</strong><br>Unlock shortcuts, burglarize stores, access secret areas and more! \u2014 if you have the right equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.poster.avif?t=1754988009\" width=680 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.webm?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688780/extras/d31a67d560cec6332da2b612399fc3de.mp4?t=1754988009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Odd Town is an immersive first-person action game that lets you explore a beautiful historical town and unveil its dark mysteries. Meet whacky characters, eat at restaurants, drink at bars, learn about the local history, find your way into restricted areas and investigate!",
